{"code":0,"data":{"title":"隐私权限自检文件上传","content":"<h2 id=\"s-3n26unlr\">app.upload.private.self.check</h2><p>功能描述：应用创建、更新，游戏更新上传隐私权限自检文件</p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-69528715\">环境信息</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\"><p><strong>环境</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"413\" style=\"width: 413px\"><p><strong>HTTPS地址</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>正式环境</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"413\" style=\"width: 413px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>https://developer-api.vivo.com.cn/router/rest</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-69531934\">公共参数</h2><p>调用任何一个API都必须传入的参数，目前支持的公共参数有：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\"><p><strong>是否必须</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"574\" style=\"width: 574px\"><p><strong>参数描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"574\" style=\"width: 574px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口名称：app.upload.private.self.check</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>access_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"574\" style=\"width: 574px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>申请API传包服务成功后vivo开放平台分配开发者接入的accessKey。</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/326\">具体获取说明</a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>timestamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"574\" style=\"width: 574px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>时间戳（毫秒）示例：1567945333425，允许客户端请求最大时间误差为20分钟。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>format</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"574\" style=\"width: 574px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>响应格式。默认值：json。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>v</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"574\" style=\"width: 574px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API协议版本，可选值：1.0。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign_method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"574\" style=\"width: 574px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名的摘要算法，可选值为：hmac。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"574\" style=\"width: 574px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API输入参数签名结果，<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/327#w1-84225273\">签名算法参照下面的介绍</a>。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>target_app_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"126\" style=\"width: 126px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"574\" style=\"width: 574px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>被调用的目标key，可选值：developer</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><h2 id=\"w1-89968267\">请求参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>请求协议</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"191,129,482\" style=\"width: 802px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>HTTPS&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>请求方式</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"191,129,482\" style=\"width: 802px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>POST</p>